# HARD FIX — RE visibility (no background-task menus)

**Scope:** Email processing chat (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`). Overrides convenience parallel-tool habits for EMAIL RE.

## Why “Finished N background tasks” / “Explored ….txt” appears

Cursor collapses **Shell / Grep / Task (subagent)** work into compact rows. Common EMAIL RE triggers:

1. **explore/Task** reading terminal capture files (`Explored 450519.txt`)
2. **Read** of `.cursor/projects/.../terminals/*.txt` instead of `run.py` Shell stdout
3. **Tools + 7-step in one message**
4. **7-step only inside tool output**

If the 7-step lives only there → **hard failure** for operator UX.

## Auto-start (operator does NOT type RE)

The agent starts turns **A→B→C automatically** when:
- **`--await-arm`** returns EMAIL extract, or
- **First case after login** is visible (`FIRST_RE_ONCE_PENDING` → agent runs `--once`).

Do **not** wait for the operator to type **RE** before extract, 7-step, or Auto-LF.

## Three-turn protocol (EMAIL) — mandatory

| Turn | What | Tools |
|------|------|-------|
| **A** | `run.py --once` (auto after login) or `--await-arm` extract | Extract Shell only |
| **A end** | Optional one-line ack; **do not** start 1–7 here | Stop when stdout shows **`RE_TEXT_ONLY_GATE`** |
| **B** | Full **7-step (sections 1–7)** plain chat text — draft while processing the email content from extract | **ZERO** |
| **C** | play-ready → Auto-LF → arm or wait PR | Tools only |

**Hard bans:** No Task/explore; no Read terminals/*.txt or latest_extract before turn B; no tools in the 7-step message; no Auto-LF before turn B visible. Matrix/KB from loaded rules/context while writing turn B. **Typed RE is not a gate** — auto-trigger only.

## Operator recovery

| Operator types | Agent / system |
|----------------|----------------|
| **`RE SHOW`** / **`visible RE`** | Re-print full 7-step as **plain main-chat text** (no “it’s in the menu”) |
| **`RE FILE`** | Run `uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/show_latest_re.py` |
| **Open file** | `.cursor/state/latest_re_visible.md` or `latest_extract.md` |

**Auto picker** often spawns explore → switch to **Composer 2.5** or **Sonnet** (named) if trays persist.

## Agent self-recovery

If tools/Auto-LF already ran with **no** visible 7-step for this Fall # in the main thread:

1. **STOP** further close-out  
2. Output the **full 7-step now** as plain chat text  
3. Continue play-ready / Auto-LF / PR / arms (skip duplicate LF if already done)

